warning[pointer_lifetime]: strict mode: `p` may outlive the storage or element it refers to along a bad path; shortest bad path shown (1 other bad path)
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/paths.jai:13:13
   |
 8 |     p := *xs[0];
   |          ------ pointer derived here
   ...
10 |     if first grow(*xs);
   |        ----- shortest bad path takes this condition as true
   |              --------- `xs` storage invalidated here
11 |     else if second grow(*xs);
   |                    --------- `xs` storage invalidated here
   ...
13 |     consume(p);
   |             ^ pointer used here after its storage was invalidated
   |
   = help: take the pointer again after growth, or store an index instead
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/pointer_lifetime

warning[pointer_lifetime]: strict mode: `p` may outlive the storage or element it refers to along a bad path; shortest bad path shown (infinitely many additional bad walks through a loop)
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/paths.jai:20:13
   |
18 |     p := *xs[0];
   |          ------ pointer derived here
19 |     while again grow(*xs);
   |           ----- shortest bad path takes this condition as true
   |           ----- shortest bad path takes this condition as false
   |                 --------- `xs` storage invalidated here
20 |     consume(p);
   |             ^ pointer used here after its storage was invalidated
   |
   = help: take the pointer again after growth, or store an index instead
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/pointer_lifetime
